<https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/arco/isCulturalPropertyComponentOf> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "is cultural property component of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà, inversa a \"ha componente\", collega una delle parti componenti di un bene culturale complesso al bene complesso stesso."@en,
        "This property, inverse of \"has component\", relates a component of a complex cultural property to the complex cultural property."@en ;
